        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-9010P, Rectangular Back-To-Back Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back Modern Rectangular Door Pull Set comes packaged as a set with 2 door pulls and the hardware needed to install them on either side of a door. Choose from 12 inch or 18 inch lengths. The Rectangular Back-To-Back Door Pull Set is available in a wide array of finish colors. The modern, flat grip makes for a stunning look on any front door be it at your home or office.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Rectangular Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BTB-9010P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BTB-9010P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia BTB-9010P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/rectangular-door-pull-omnia-9010p\"><b>Thru-Bolt Mounted Single Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>",
